# Keep LF everywhere: scripts run inside WSL/BusyBox and CRLF breaks them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.img binary
# The Doors graphics package is kept byte-for-byte as supplied, so the hashes
# in docs/design/brand/README.md stay true (its OFL text has CRLF endings).
docs/design/brand/doors-threshold/** -text
